{"parse": {"title": "Karim L\u00f3pez", "pageid": 17484017, "redirects": [], "text": {"*": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"fr\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"bandeau-container metadata homonymie hatnote\"><div class=\"bandeau-cell bandeau-icone\" style=\"display:table-cell;padding-right:0.5em\"><span class=\"noviewer\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Aide:Homonymie\" title=\"Aide:Homonymie\"><img alt=\"Page d\u2019aide sur l\u2019homonymie\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a9/Logo_disambig.svg/20px-Logo_disambig.svg.png?utm_source=fr.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"15\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a9/Logo_disambig.svg/40px-Logo_disambig.svg.png?utm_source=fr.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"512\" data-file-height=\"375\" /></a></span></div><div class=\"bandeau-cell\" style=\"display:table-cell;padding-right:0.5em\">\n<p>Pour les articles homonymes, voir <a href=\"/wiki/Karim\" class=\"mw-disambig\" title=\"Karim\">Karim</a> et <a href=\"/wiki/L%C3%B3pez\" class=\"mw-disambig\" title=\"L\u00f3pez\">L\u00f3pez</a>.\n</p>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"bandeau-container metadata bandeau-article bandeau-niveau-ebauche\"><div class=\"bandeau-cell bandeau-icone\" style=\"display:table-cell;padding-right:0.5em\"><span style=\"white-space:nowrap;word-spacing:5px\"><span class=\"noviewer\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fichier:Basketball_ball.svg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/5a/Basketball_ball.svg/40px-Basketball_ball.svg.png?utm_source=fr.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"33\" height=\"35\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/5a/Basketball_ba