> </span><a href=\"/wiki/Mexique\" title=\"Mexique\">Mexique</a></span>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th scope=\"row\">Naissance\n</th>\n<td colspan=\"2\"><time class=\"nowrap date-lien\" datetime=\"2007-04-12\" data-sort-value=\"2007-04-12\"><a href=\"/wiki/12_avril_en_sport\" title=\"12 avril en sport\">12</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Avril_2007_en_sport\" title=\"Avril 2007 en sport\">avril</a> <a href=\"/wiki/2007_en_basket-ball\" title=\"2007 en basket-ball\">2007</a></time><span class=\"noprint\"> (19&#160;ans)</span><br /><a href=\"/wiki/Hermosillo\" title=\"Hermosillo\">Hermosillo</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/%C3%89tat_de_Sonora\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"\u00c9tat de Sonora\">Sonora</a>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n\n<th scope=\"row\">Taille\n</th>\n<td colspan=\"2\">2,06&#160;<a href=\"/wiki/M%C3%A8tre\" title=\"M\u00e8tre\">m</a> (6<a href=\"/wiki/Pied_(unit%C3%A9)\" title=\"Pied (unit\u00e9)\">\u2032</a>&#160;9<a href=\"/wiki/Pouce_(unit%C3%A9)\" title=\"Pouce (unit\u00e9)\">\u2033</a>)\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th scope=\"row\">Poids\n</th>\n<td colspan=\"2\">102&#160;<a href=\"/wiki/Kilogramme\" title=\"Kilogramme\">kg</a> (224&#160;<a href=\"/wiki/Livre_(unit%C3%A9)\" title=\"Livre (unit\u00e9)\">lb</a>)\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n\n<th colspan=\"3\" style=\"padding:4px; text-align:center; background-color:#DD8F56; color:#000000\">Situation en club</th></tr>\n<tr>\n\n\n<th scope=\"row\">Poste\n</th>\n<td colspan=\"2\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ailier_(basket-ball)\" title=\"Ailier (basket-ball)\">Ailier</a>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n\n\n<th colspan=\"3\" style=\"padding:4px; text-align:center; background-color:#DD8F56; color:#000000\">Draft de la NBA</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th scope=\"row\">Ann\u00e9e\n</th>\n<td colspan=\"2\"><a href=\"/wiki/Draft_2026_de_la_NBA\" title=\"Draft 2026 de la NBA\">2026</a>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th scope=\"row\">Position\n</th>\n<td colspan=\"2\"><abbr class=\"abbr\" title=\"Vingt et uni\u00e8me\">21<sup>e</sup></abbr>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th scope=\"row\">Franchise\n</th>\n<td colspan=\"2\"><a href=\"/wiki/Pistons_de_D%C3%A9troit\" title=\"Pistons de D\u00e9troit\">Pistons de D\u00e9troit</a>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th colspan=\"3\" style=\"padding:4px; text-align:center; background-color:#DD8F56; color:#000000\">Carri\u00e8re professionnelle *</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:28%;\"><b>Saison</b></td><td><b>Club</b></td><td><b><abbr class=\"abbr\" title=\"Moyenne\">Moy.</abbr> <abbr class=\"abbr\" title=\"points\">pts</abbr></b></td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td valign=\"top\">2022-2023<br />2023-2024<br />2024<br />2024-2025<br />2025-2026<br /><a href=\"/wiki/Saison_NBA_2026-2027\" title=\"Saison NBA 2026-2027\">2026-2027</a></td><td valign=\"top\"><a href=\"/wiki/Joventut_Badalona\" title=\"Joventut Badalona\">Joventut Badalona B</a><br /><span style=\"cursor:help;\" title=\"Pr\u00eat\u00e9 \u00e0\">\u2192</span> <a href=\"/w/index.php?title=CB_Prat&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"CB Prat (page inexistante)\">CB Prat</a>&#160;<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/CB_Prat\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"en:CB Prat\"><span class=\"indicateur-langue\" title=\"Article en anglais&#160;: \u00ab&#160;CB Prat&#160;\u00bb\">(en)</span></a><br />Joventut Badalona<br /><span class=\"nowrap\"><a href=\"/wiki/New_Zealand_Breakers\" title=\"New Zealand Breakers\">New Zealand Breakers</a></span><br />New Zealand Breakers<br /><a href=\"/wiki/Grizzlies_de_Memphis\" title=\"Grizzlies de Memphis\">Grizzlies de Memphis</a></td><td valign=\"top\"><s style=\"visibility:hidden;color:transparent\">0</s>-<br /><s style=\"visibility:hidden;color:transparent\">0</s>2,1<br /><s style=\"visibility:hidden;color:transparent\">0</s>0,5<br /><s style=\"visibility:hidden;color:transparent\">0</s>9,6<br />11,9</td></tr>\n<tr>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<td colspan=\"3\"><hr style=\"height:2px; color:inherit; background-color:#DD8F56;\" /></td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;color:#555555;\"><small>* Points marqu\u00e9s dans chaque club dans le cadre de la saison r\u00e9guli\u00e8re du championnat national.</small></td>\n</tr><tr>\n\n<td class=\"navigation-only\" colspan=\"3\" style=\"border-top: 2px #DD8F56 solid; font-size: 80%; background:inherit; color: inherit; text-align: right;\"><span class=\"plainlinks\" style=\"float:left;\"><a class=\"external text\" data-mw-original-href=\"//fr.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=Karim_L%C3%B3pez&amp;action=edit&amp;section=0\" href=\"https://fr.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=Karim_L%C3%B3pez&amp;action=edit&amp;section=0\"><span class=\"infodoc\">modifier</span></a></span>&#160;<span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Mod%C3%A8le:Infobox_Joueur_de_basket-ball\" title=\"Consultez la documentation du mod\u00e8le\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/38/Info_Simple.svg/20px-Info_Simple.svg.png?utm_source=fr.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"12\" height=\"12\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/38/Info_Simple.svg/40px-Info_Simple.svg.png?utm_source=fr.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"512\" data-file-height=\"512\" /></a></span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><b>Karim Hiram L\u00f3pez Mondaca</b>, n\u00e9 le <time class=\"nowrap date-lien\" datetime=\"2007-04-12\" data-sort-value=\"2007-04-12\"><a href=\"/wiki/12_avril_en_sport\" title=\"12 avril en sport\">12</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Avril_2007_en_sport\" title=\"Avril 2007 en sport\">avril</a> <a href=\"/wiki/2007_en_basket-ball\" title=\"2007 en basket-ball\">2007</a></time> \u00e0 <a href=\"/wiki/Hermosillo\" title=\"Hermosillo\">Hermosillo</a> \u00e0 <a href=\"/wiki/%C3%89tat_de_Sonora\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"\u00c9tat de Sonora\">Sonora</a>, est un joueur <a href=\"/wiki/Mexique\" title=\"Mexique\">mexicain</a> de <a href=\"/wiki/Basket-ball\" title=\"Basket-ball\">basket-ball</a> \u00e9voluant au poste d'<a href=\"/wiki/Ailier_(basket-ball)\" title=\"Ailier (basket-ball)\">ailier</a>.\n</p>\n<meta property=\"mw:PageProp/toc\" />\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Biographie\">Biographie</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Karim_L%C3%B3pez&amp;veaction=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Modifier la section\u202f: Biographie\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>modifier</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Karim_L%C3%B3pez&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Modifier le code source de la section : Biographie\"><span>modifier le code</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading3\"><h3 id=\"Carri\u00e8re_professionnelle\"><span id=\"Carri.C3.A8re_professionnelle\"></span>Carri\u00e8re professionnelle</h3><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Karim_L%C3%B3pez&amp;veaction=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Modifier la section\u202f: Carri\u00e8re professionnelle\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>modifier</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Karim_L%C3%B3pez&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Modifier le code source de la section : Carri\u00e8re professionnelle\"><span>modifier le code</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading4\"><h4 id=\"Joventut_Badalona_(2022-2024)\"><span id=\"Joventut_Badalona_.282022-2024.29\"></span>Joventut Badalona (2022-2024)</h4><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Karim_L%C3%B3pez&amp;veaction=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Modifier la section\u202f: Joventut Badalona (2022-2024)\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>modifier</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Karim_L%C3%B3pez&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Modifier le code source de la section : Joventut Badalona (2022-2024)\"><span>modifier le code</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<p>L\u00f3pez joue deux saisons avec l'\u00e9quipe B de <a href=\"/wiki/Joventut_Badalona\" title=\"Joventut Badalona\">Joventut Badalona</a>, entre 2022 et 2024. Il est int\u00e9gr\u00e9 \u00e0 l'effectif professionnel en 2024 et dispute quatre matches durant la saison 2023-2024.\n</p>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading4\"><h4 id=\"New_Zealand_Breakers_(2024-2026)\"><span id=\"New_Zealand_Breakers_.282024-2026.29\"></span>New Zealand Breakers (2024-2026)</h4><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Karim_L%C3%B3pez&amp;veaction=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Modifier la section\u202f: New Zealand Breakers (2024-2026)\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>modifier</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Karim_L%C3%B3pez&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Modifier le code source de la section : New Zealand Breakers (2024-2026)\"><span>modifier le code</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<p>Apr\u00e8s la saison 2023-2024, il quitte Joventut et signe avec l'\u00e9quipe des <a href=\"/wiki/New_Zealand_Breakers\" title=\"New Zealand Breakers\">New Zealand Breakers</a> du <a href=\"/wiki/National_Basketball_League_(Australie)\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"National Basketball League (Australie)\">championnat australien</a><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>. Il a impressionn\u00e9 avec les Breakers, devenant le plus jeune joueur de l'histoire de la <a href=\"/wiki/National_Basketball_League_(Australie)\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"National Basketball League (Australie)\">NBL</a> \u00e0 r\u00e9aliser un double-double en octobre 2024. En 25 matchs lors de la saison 2024-2025, il a affich\u00e9 une moyenne de 9,6 points et 4,7 rebonds.\n</p><p>Le 30 janvier 2026, L\u00f3pez \u00e9tablit son record de points en carri\u00e8re avec 32 unit\u00e9s dans la victoire 97 \u00e0 95 cotre le <a href=\"/wiki/Melbourne_United\" title=\"Melbourne United\">Melbourne United</a>.\n</p><p>Le <time class=\"nowrap\" datetime=\"2026-03-23\" data-sort-value=\"2026-03-23\">23 mars 2026</time>, il s'inscrit \u00e0 la <a href=\"/wiki/Draft_2026_de_la_NBA\" title=\"Draft 2026 de la NBA\">draft 2026 de la NBA</a><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-2\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>.\n</p>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Palmar\u00e8s\"><span id=\"Palmar.C3.A8s\"></span>Palmar\u00e8s</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Karim_L%C3%B3pez&amp;veaction=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Modifier la section\u202f: Palmar\u00e8s\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>modifier</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Karim_L%C3%B3pez&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Modifier le code source de la section : Palmar\u00e8s\"><span>modifier le code</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading3\"><h3 id=\"En_club\">En club</h3><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Karim_L%C3%B3pez&amp;veaction=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Modifier la section\u202f: En club\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>modifier</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Karim_L%C3%B3pez&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Modifier le code source de la section : En club\"><span>modifier le code</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<ul><li>Vainqueur de la Coupe NBL Ignite (2026)</li></ul>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"R\u00e9f\u00e9rences\"><span id=\"R.C3.A9f.C3.A9rences\"></span>R\u00e9f\u00e9rences</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Karim_L%C3%B3pez&amp;veaction=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Modifier la section\u202f: R\u00e9f\u00e9rences\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>modifier</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Karim_L%C3%B3pez&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Modifier le code source de la section : R\u00e9f\u00e9rences\"><span>modifier le code</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"references-small decimal\" style=\"\"><div class=\"mw-references-wrap\"><ol class=\"references\">\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-1\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-1\">\u2191</a> </span><span class=\"reference-text\"><span class=\"ouvrage\" id=\"Demay2024\"><span class=\"ouvrage\" id=\"Jonathan&#95;Demay2024\">Jonathan Demay, \u00ab&#160;<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.basketusa.com/news/728445/le-prospect-mexicain-karim-lopez-file-en-australie/\"><cite style=\"font-style:normal;\">Le prospect mexicain Karim Lopez file en Australie</cite></a>&#160;\u00bb, sur <span class=\"italique\">basketusa.com</span>, <time class=\"nowrap\" datetime=\"2024-08-10\" data-sort-value=\"2024-08-10\">10 ao\u00fbt 2024</time> <small style=\"line-height:1em;\">(consult\u00e9 le <time class=\"nowrap\" datetime=\"2026-06-22\" data-sort-value=\"2026-06-22\">22 juin 2026</time>)</small></span></span></span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-2\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-2\">\u2191</a> </span><span class=\"reference-tex